Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.18,0:00:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}便宜啦便宜啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.87,0:00:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天点心大特价！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.23,0:00:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人气点心全都半价哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯～。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.62,0:00:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}酥脆脆的佩罗奇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.27,0:00:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}软绵绵的巧克力章鱼烧 酱油味。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.67,0:00:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都是真货乌拉。 居然还半价。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！ 大家要小心乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.73,0:00:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里的点心里面有内幕乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}内幕！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有内幕吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小子！ 你是来找我们店茬的吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.65,0:00:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？ 我不过是说了实话乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.01,0:00:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这世上全是内幕。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.86,0:00:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用决斗来证明给你看乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了乌拉！ 永续陷阱 内幕陷阱C！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.13,0:00:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:45.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那… 那张卡是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤古雷扎乌鲁斯乌拉！

Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.44,0:01:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知道厉害了吧，乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.64,0:01:04.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是社会乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按照约定，这家伙我就收下了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.37,0:01:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《凡事都有背面乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.23,0:01:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}点心半价促销就不用说了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.54,0:01:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}妈妈心情好也是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.78,0:01:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有作业也是》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.30,0:01:20.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.66,0:01:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说了，是真的啦……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.85,0:01:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.34,0:01:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反过来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.05,0:01:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，那家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.57,0:01:31.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《事物必定有背面乌拉》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.77,0:01:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打扫，打扫。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.12,0:01:36.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《当然，那家伙也有背面乌拉》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.82,0:01:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}倒过来，倒过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.68,0:01:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而现在最可疑的就是那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.54,0:01:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.23,0:01:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐姐让我去跑腿来着{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.58,0:01:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.94,0:01:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.64,0:01:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个少年……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.17,0:01:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那个决斗很烂出了名的九十九游马竟然{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.37,0:02:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了参加过全国大赛的鲨鱼什么的……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.89,0:02:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这背后一定有内幕内幕。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他肯定有一张超厉害的卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.95,0:02:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 要想得到那张卡就把这个交给他{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.49,0:02:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带进决斗里的话……》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早上好。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.12,0:02:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早上好。

Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.24,0:02:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.93,0:02:22.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙说 希望别人这么叫他。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.78,0:02:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.31,0:02:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们不是一直都叫他幽灵吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不是幽灵。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.52,0:02:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是从星光世界来的星光体啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.07,0:02:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是来啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.59,0:02:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙从昨天开始真的超烦的～。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是这家伙。是星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 我知道了啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.50,0:02:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然还给他起名字了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.63,0:02:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下可真是重伤啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.20,0:02:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.05,0:02:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这不是游马君吗啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.81,0:02:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家这么开心在聊什么啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.61,0:02:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会是在说我坏话吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.49,0:02:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.15,0:03:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过我完全不在意啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说坏话也行 背后议论大欢迎啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这个少年确实昨天…》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.24,0:03:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.61,0:03:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不认识我吗啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.10,0:03:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}表面的身份　只是个中学生。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}背后的身份也是　只是个中学生。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.66,0:03:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}表与里　表里一体！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.02,0:03:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}表里德之助　就是本大爷乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.72,0:03:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隔壁班的乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.92,0:03:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其实　我正想着要把这个送给游马君{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.94,0:03:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直等着呢乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}宝贝·德拉贡　超量怪兽乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.16,0:03:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量怪兽！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.35,0:03:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是你打倒鲨鱼的谢礼乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.04,0:03:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷也被那家伙　整得够惨的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.35,0:03:42.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吃了不少苦头乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.57,0:03:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是友情的证明乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.10,0:03:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}友情的证明吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.62,0:03:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的　可以收下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.65,0:03:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那是什么……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.34,0:03:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从他体内溢出的那股异样的东西……》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用客气啦，乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:03:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}收下吧，乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.07,0:04:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我就不客气了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.76,0:04:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！今天轮到你给花浇水了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.13,0:04:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.16,0:04:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.32,0:04:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不快点就来不及了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.13,0:04:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂、喂，可是卡还……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.02,0:04:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行哦，从德之助那里拿什么卡之类的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.40,0:04:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为、为什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.43,0:04:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们小学的时候同班过，所以我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙做的事，背后一定有猫腻。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.66,0:04:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小心点。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.92,0:04:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猫腻？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.00,0:04:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他看起来不像是那种人啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.21,0:04:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《切 碍事的家伙冒出来了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.92,0:04:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 这点程度我可不会放弃乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.78,0:04:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡我一定要交出去乌拉》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.84,0:06:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 在这种情况下要说什么是正确答案的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.90,0:06:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这座巨大的建筑物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.23,0:06:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被分成了好几个区块。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.11,0:06:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是为了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说回来 刚才那个少年…》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.75,0:06:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.98,0:06:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.53,0:07:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.55,0:07:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把卡…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.90,0:07:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.25,0:07:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.96,0:07:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 大意和破绽根本一点都没有嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.49,0:07:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们几个是不是怀疑得有点过头了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.68,0:07:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶 被完全防住了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就没法把卡交给游马了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.24,0:07:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪里有没有超量怪兽之类的掉在地上啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.95,0:07:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那家伙是跟游马同班的太一。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.65,0:07:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙能派上用场乌拉》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.51,0:07:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎，真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.58,0:07:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}约好了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去啦，去，绝对去啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了，超幸运！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.43,0:07:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《傻子和剪刀看怎么用。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.96,0:07:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第一阶段，成功乌拉》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.98,0:07:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我回来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.83,0:07:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.34,0:07:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你该不会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在玩决斗怪兽吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.37,0:07:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎，没玩啊，那种东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.56,0:07:57.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.27,0:08:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}“致决斗之王游马大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.62,0:08:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来自游马大人的超级粉丝”。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎，不会吧，粉丝信？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.35,0:08:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.54,0:08:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！真是的，我都说了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.50,0:08:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么多次不准决斗了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.91,0:08:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奶奶你知道啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.94,0:08:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对游马来说，决斗可不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.20,0:08:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}单纯的决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.83,0:08:26.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，跑哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.00,0:08:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算了，无所谓。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.87,0:08:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿，怎么样，厉害吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是粉丝信啊，粉丝信！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？粉丝信是有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果来着{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.97,0:08:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不问吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}粉丝信这东西啊{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是“我是你的粉丝，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.91,0:08:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最喜欢你了”这样的信哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你是被禁止决斗了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.07,0:08:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？跟你没关系吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.60,0:08:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比起这个，粉丝信，粉丝信！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《观察结果其８
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.56,0:08:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马被禁止决斗了》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.35,0:09:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？这不是德之助
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想要给我的宝贝龙卡吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:10.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.97,0:09:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我攒了零花钱买的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请务必拿去用。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.35,0:09:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿～还真有这种巧合啊，嘿嘿嘿。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.56,0:09:22.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了，怪兽超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.09,0:09:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第二阶段，成功啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.95,0:09:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的就是最后的收尾啦，哼。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.66,0:09:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这个贴到这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.87,0:09:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来游马就完蛋啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.23,0:09:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识见识世间的背面吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.87,0:09:43.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早上好！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.93,0:09:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没想到你竟然是这种人！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.87,0:09:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然在背地里干那种事。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.92,0:09:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}背地里！？我做了什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.51,0:09:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做了什么？装傻也该有个限度吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.52,0:09:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家的手机里被发来了匿名照片。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.93,0:10:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总而言之，你做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.47,0:10:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们全都知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏花坛，对老师恶作剧，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}考试还作弊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.07,0:10:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}甚至还吃了太一君的便当，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.22,0:10:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后把青蛙放了进去！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.86,0:10:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受伤的太一君今天都请假没来学校！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～！？那个太一？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.94,0:10:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说……我怎么可能做那种事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我不是说了嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}肯定是哪里搞错了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.26,0:10:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马才不是那种背地里偷偷摸摸的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们俩想袒护游马君的心情我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.41,0:10:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是确实是有证据的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.43,0:10:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…我跟你绝交。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.45,0:10:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好了，各位，我们走吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.39,0:10:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～！等…等一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.08,0:10:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是跟游马扯上关系
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.96,0:10:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}准没好事。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.99,0:10:51.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说了不是我啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.74,0:10:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《作战 大成功里！》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.22,0:11:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.76,0:11:03.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这里也找不到决斗的对手啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.45,0:11:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唉…为什么会
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.20,0:11:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成这样啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.88,0:11:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我明明什么都没做…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.81,0:11:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}“里”到底是什么效果？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.64,0:11:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}里？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.95,0:11:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你被讨厌的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.89,0:11:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在于那个效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.01,0:11:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所谓“里”，就是心里想的和
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是在想别的事情。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.57,0:11:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别的事情……人类
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.61,0:11:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有这种特性吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.15,0:11:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要是人，谁都会有啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.49,0:11:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此，游马……为什么你没有？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.55,0:11:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.55,0:11:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有啊！我就算是我，也有表里不一的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.36,0:11:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.19,0:11:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在这种地方干什么呢乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.99,0:11:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然发生过那种事乌拉……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.69,0:11:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}完全被无视了嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实会让人消沉啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.54,0:11:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，我相信游马君乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.04,0:11:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:11:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其实我……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.49,0:12:00.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看了鲨鱼和游马君的决斗乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.42,0:12:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要看决斗就能明白乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.84,0:12:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.86,0:12:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说回来，打倒鲨鱼的那张卡……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.01,0:12:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是什么来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.12,0:12:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.43,0:12:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对 对… 就是那个汪！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.63,0:12:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《希望皇 霍普吗》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.69,0:12:24.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《他那异样的力量正在变强。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.13,0:12:25.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这到底是…》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.39,0:12:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打起精神来汪！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.76,0:12:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管大家怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.31,0:12:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我都是游马君这边的汪！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:34.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《到底要干什么？》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.17,0:12:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助… 你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.64,0:12:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其实是个超级好的家伙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.41,0:12:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵！比起这个 要不要来场决斗汪？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.61,0:12:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种时候就得靠决斗汪。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.74,0:12:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用决斗来爽快一下汪！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.11,0:12:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！来决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.57,0:12:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《蠢货！上钩了汪。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.38,0:12:56.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样希望皇 霍普就是我的了汪》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.73,0:12:58.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最好避免和他决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.76,0:13:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有种不祥的预感。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.41,0:13:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不祥的预感！？难道你连
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.15,0:13:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助都怀疑吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助他可是在鼓励我啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.95,0:13:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是所谓的友情啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.29,0:13:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在一个人自言自语什么呢乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.33,0:13:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.05,0:13:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没……没什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.47,0:13:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，赶紧来决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.30,0:13:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！一飞冲天啊，我！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.41,0:13:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.29,0:13:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}目标 锁定！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.18,0:13:30.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR视觉 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.97,0:13:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻就由我拿下了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.97,0:13:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我以里侧守备表示 盖放一只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.19,0:13:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.10,0:13:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开始巩固防守了吗 德之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手是打败了那条鲨鱼的游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}慎重行事吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.18,0:13:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……你这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:13:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是慎重一点比较好。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.62,0:14:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！你给我闭嘴！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.82,0:14:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《又在一个人自言自语了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.94,0:14:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是什么作战吗？》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.37,0:14:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《里侧守备怪兽不试着攻击一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.81,0:14:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就不知道守备力。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.64,0:14:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但要是贸然攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方的守备力超过了我方的攻击力的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候就会按那个差值
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.83,0:14:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我方受到伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.78,0:14:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此……》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.17,0:14:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《召唤攻击力高的怪兽》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.65,0:14:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.78,0:14:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用我我我魔术师攻击里侧守备怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.91,0:14:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《毫无戒备地竟然攻过来了……》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.32,0:14:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}针弹骨 现身吧呜拉！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.67,0:14:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕噢噢！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.43,0:14:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备力 ４００。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.94,0:14:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 我我我魔术师的胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.89,0:14:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反转效果呜拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.43,0:15:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反转效果！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.84,0:15:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以里侧守备表示 盖放的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.65,0:15:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反转效果怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.15,0:15:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成表侧表示的时候可以发动反转效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.73,0:15:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反转效果 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.51,0:15:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予４００点伤害呜拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.60,0:15:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 还挺能干的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我我我魔术师的攻击力更高。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.43,0:15:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我赢了！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被干掉了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.14,0:15:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 就扯平了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.24,0:15:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.86,0:15:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是游马君 不可小看呜拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我做到了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.39,0:15:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}削掉了游马的生命值乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.51,0:15:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了！ 乌拉 乌拉～。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.29,0:15:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他是反转效果怪兽的使用者吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.59,0:15:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不好意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太一君的妈妈 平时
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.72,0:15:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说过他去学校了对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.14,0:15:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊… 到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.07,0:15:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定 发给大家的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.48,0:16:00.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}照片里 有线索…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.40,0:16:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对啊！ 照片啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也许能证明游马的清白。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.31,0:16:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！ 抽卡乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.91,0:16:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备表示 盖放一只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}里侧守备怪兽…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又在瞄准反转效果吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.92,0:16:20.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上盖两张卡，回合结束乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.64,0:16:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《他看穿了游马的攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.93,0:16:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底想瞄准什么？》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.68,0:16:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！我的回合。抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤全力精灵。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.37,0:16:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.23,0:16:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用全力精灵攻击里侧守备怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.23,0:16:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只里侧守备怪兽不能攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.11,0:16:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.92,0:16:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算被反转效果造成伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.21,0:16:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要用全力精灵打倒里侧守备表示的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.99,0:16:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能用我我我魔术师直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.08,0:16:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，全力精灵！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.72,0:16:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击里侧守备怪兽！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.46,0:16:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《果然来了乌拉……》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.88,0:16:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}白骨怪现身乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.99,0:17:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备力300。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，这样的话就能打倒。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.70,0:17:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反转效果汪。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.63,0:17:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从自己的卡组把最多3只啾骨Jr{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.96,0:17:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在对方的场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.46,0:17:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以守备表示特殊召唤汪。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.48,0:17:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？召唤到我的场地上！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.10,0:17:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.14,0:17:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了汪！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.48,0:17:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤成功了汪！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.87,0:17:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.45,0:17:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算在我的场地上召唤怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.75,0:17:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也没有意义吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.03,0:17:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……糟了汪！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.82,0:17:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞错效果了汪……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.11,0:17:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《搞错了？》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.65,0:17:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊……我也经常这样呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.17,0:17:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}懂……我懂你。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.12,0:17:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 那也是 决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.46,0:17:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可不会 手下留情。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.49,0:17:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}略略略……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.74,0:17:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用我我我魔术师
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.23,0:17:56.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对德之助直接攻击！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.94,0:18:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.97,0:18:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！生命值是3600对2500。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.63,0:18:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}逆转了！这样一来我就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.43,0:18:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等……等……等一下乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.61,0:18:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.12,0:18:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不超量召唤吗乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.59,0:18:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.49,0:18:16.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那个笨蛋 还没注意到乌拉……》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君 就算是我失误了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.57,0:18:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也不用这么客气乌拉……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.34,0:18:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.21,0:18:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说 是我失误才召唤出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.33,0:18:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级1的啾骨Jr.！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.44,0:18:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.43,0:18:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相同等级1的怪兽有3只……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.27,0:18:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了！可以超量召唤嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.22,0:18:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《真是个让人操心的家伙 乌拉》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.30,0:18:38.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《明显是在引诱对方进行超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.49,0:18:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 是那张卡！》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.17,0:18:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 3只等级1的啾骨Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.13,0:18:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.30,0:18:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.49,0:18:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽 构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.84,0:18:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！ 现身吧 宝贝龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.94,0:19:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了～！ 超量召唤成功了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.85,0:19:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜啦呜啦… 哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.28,0:19:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}中计了吧 九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.09,0:19:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}中计了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.82,0:19:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 永续陷阱 乌啦啦C。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.75,0:19:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乌啦啦C？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.70,0:19:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乌啦啦C是 在对方场地上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.20,0:19:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}宝贝龙被召唤的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方额外卡组中的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.37,0:19:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽超量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.04,0:19:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤到自己的场地上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.16,0:19:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并可以将这张卡装备上去的呜啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.74,0:19:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从我的额外卡组里！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.47,0:19:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说希望皇 霍普是 我的了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 我拿下了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把宝贝龙 超量召唤出来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.43,0:19:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是你运气到头了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.27,0:19:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.96,0:19:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他为了让 宝贝龙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.92,0:20:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行超量召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.89,0:20:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在游马的场上特殊召唤了 白骨Jr.。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.61,0:20:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.29,0:20:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 为什么 我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.93,0:20:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有宝贝龙这件事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:11.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助会知道呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.63,0:20:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.99,0:20:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攒了零花钱买来的哦～
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.11,0:20:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 那封粉丝信的寄信人……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.07,0:20:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来是德之助啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.47,0:20:25.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不止这些哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.53,0:20:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发到大家手机上的那些假照片{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.29,0:20:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了把你孤立起来再接近你也是我发的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.21,0:20:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.98,0:20:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有事情都有内幕。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.64,0:20:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}像你这种蠢货会收到粉丝信{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.93,0:20:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家的手机上会收到假照片{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.93,0:20:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 当然 这场决斗也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.43,0:20:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看看你背上的纸哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.75,0:20:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}背上的纸？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.34,0:20:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么时候 贴了这种东西！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.68,0:20:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗中 赢的一方可以从输的一方{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.77,0:20:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得到一张喜欢的卡你同意吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.79,0:21:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赌卡规则……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:02.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……德之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.26,0:21:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要我赢了希望皇 霍普就归我了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.43,0:21:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.56,0:21:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你从一开始就打算
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.93,0:21:10.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗我吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.58,0:21:11.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说相信我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.39,0:21:14.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些话还有说会站到我这边{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:17.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都是骗人的吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这世上尽是谎言。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.02,0:21:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被骗的一方才是笨蛋乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.24,0:21:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.41,0:21:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是人类的谎言……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.03,0:21:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那股诡异力量的真面目吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.50,0:21:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做好觉悟吧乌拉！永续陷阱 谎言陷阱C！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.40,0:21:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.31,0:21:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从游马的额外卡组
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.47,0:21:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤 希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.68,0:21:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备这张卡吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.44,0:21:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，希望皇 霍普！

Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.57,0:22:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普被夺走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.80,0:22:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来决斗吧！本周的问题！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.94,0:22:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隆隆隆石人的攻击力是1800。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.96,0:22:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和攻击力1400的巴格曼Y战斗的话，会怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.95,0:23:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助，为什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.61,0:23:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要骗人才能赢啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.91,0:23:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗也是这样啊。不赢就没有意义啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.13,0:23:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对！那种东西才不是决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.44,0:23:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的 No.卡我全都收下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.53,0:23:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男，你要证明游马是无辜的。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.40,0:24:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要保护好……宝贝龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.90,0:24:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下集 游戏王ZEXAL
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.96,0:24:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}背叛的 No.卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.23,0:24:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧！我！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.40,0:24:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隆隆隆石人破坏巴格曼Y。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.11,0:24:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且攻击力之差400点
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.95,0:24:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会变成对对手玩家的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.41,0:24:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了！

